っ先にやったことが群島各島への遠泳だったというのは、もはや伝説レベル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"毎朝早朝、寮の前で元気に体操する姿と、それから二度寝して遅刻ギリギリに校舎へ駆け込む姿は、学園の名物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アバウト＆ノープランな行動と言動ゆえか、教師ウケはあまりよろしくないものの、裏表がない（単細胞な？）明るさのおかげで学生たちからの人気は絶大。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"38962"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"38962","value":"食堂への近道発見"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"38962","value":"毎朝の体操"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/ed64d1c19a58b5c3aadc7756b90ca48f5228f8974a80bdf425314a6581b1d270.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/331ddf59a455759cf790b037e45e52701493562eb0f657e027b3c1a9b10273df.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"壱智村小真","creatorId":"vndb:s364","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s364","name":"壱智村 小真","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:15973:38962:4830:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c53039","characterName":"ナタリア・エッフェンベルク","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"38964","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"15973"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15361"],"vndbCharacterId":"c53039"},"originalCharacterName":"ナタリア・エッフェンベルク","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【生真面目な『影の生徒会長』】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"職業：学園6期生　趣味：勉強・自己研鑽　特技：今は家事全般"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園6期生。風紀委員書記を務める、勤勉な人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さる王国の貴族階級出身だが、社会勉強のため留学中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やや杓子定規な性格で融通が利かないところもあるが、その生真面目さと公正さを慕う者も多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"役職は風紀委員長だが、生徒会内部では副会長以上に頼られており、実質的にはナタリアが生徒会を回しているとも言える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"厳しいが、いざ頼られると突き放せない、苦労型の人"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15361","sourceWorkId":"12402","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園6期生。風紀委員書記を務める、勤勉な人。さる王国の貴族階級出身だが、社会勉強のため留学中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特別扱いを嫌い、一般学生と同じように寮に入り、生活している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やや杓子定規な性格で融通が利かないところもあるが、その生真面目さと公正さを慕う者も多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フラン＆クロエの2名が同室になると聞き、もう一人誰か監督的な人間を付けた方がいい、と提案。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"すると、あっさり『じゃあ、お前がやれ。風紀委員だし』と言い渡され、相部屋が決まってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある意味、ヤブヘビで貧乏くじな人。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"38964"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"38964","value":"今は家事全般"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"38964","value":"勉強・自己研鑽"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/382b67aff9778180fbce19e33c22371b8880e8295b0f927fa1284d01dd83777d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8a4b45b26d9e54c3695c1ff87d2a6685edd1260edf46d0db90ad6e8e4a79ebf2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"永見はるか","creatorId":"vndb:s452","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s452","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s452","name":"永見 はるか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:15973:38964:4674:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c53040","characterName":"クロエ・ニーヴン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"38963","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"15973"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15360"],"vndbCharacterId":"c53040"},"originalCharacterName":"クロエ・ニーヴン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【学園生ながらその知識はすでに教員クラス】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"職業：学園6期生　趣味：読書・観察・人をからかうこと　特技：一読した本の暗記"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園6期生。古書管理委員会委員長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『一度読んだ本の内容は決して忘れない』という特技を持つ秀才。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、生来の不器用が災いして、正確なのは覚えた知識だけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"落ち着いた物腰で、常に冷静沈着。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールだが面倒見はよく、とくに後輩からは慕われ、シンパも多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優秀な記憶力を誇示するようにウンチクを語るのが好きだが、同じくらいに真面目な顔でボケるのが大好き。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15360","sourceWorkId":"12402","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園6期生。古書管理委員会委員長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『一度読んだ本の内容は決して忘れない』という特技を持つ秀才。落ち着いた物腰で、常に冷静沈着。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールだが面倒見はよく、とくに後輩からは慕われ、シンパも多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ウンチクを語るのが好きだが、同じくらいに真面目な顔でボケるのが大好きなので、話を鵜呑みにするとたまにバカを見ることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見、しっかり者に見えるが、実は超絶的に手先が不器用。整理整頓・掃除・洗濯・炊事、すべて人並み以下。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"およそ日常生活においては、理屈倒れな人。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"38963"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"38963","value":"一読した本の暗記"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"38963","value":"読書・観察・人をからかうこと"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b0/b02fcdf366b030fc9e07fff403d975467b606a8116c7dd74c2e1f2610d7f6d63.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7e3ad763fa7d7d51c3d36f58fb06266c8eda0986af1c54795e5429ca7b72b5a9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山川琴美","creatorId":"vndb:s1173","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1173","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1173","name":"山川 琴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:15973:38963:4799:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c53041","characterName":"フローラ・メイフィールド","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["15362"],"vndbCharacterId":"c53041"},"originalCharacterName":"フローラ・メイフィールド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【フランの妹分・暴走エロ少女】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"職業：学園5期生　趣味：女の子の観察・女の子とスキンシップ　特技：嗅覚が鋭い"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園5期生。生徒会役員（役職なし）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"入学当初からフランチェスカを慕い、妹分を自認する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"……というか、恋愛対象ど真ん中。性的欲求の対象。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女の子なのは身体と声だけ、その中身はまさに（主にダメな方向で）思春期の男子そのもの。エロレズ小僧。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エルグラント魔法王国出身であるため、自然精霊との親和性が高く、実は成績もトップクラス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今年中に使い魔召喚の儀式にチャレンジするつもりだが、フランがいまだに成功していないため、先を越してしまうのはマズイなぁ、といろいろ苦悩中。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15362","sourceWorkId":"12402","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4dbdaaf0a665e4c34ce07b889b961f39b6803d797a1cfa6234892053ac93d79c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/798940354722325affc7a881380b3807e288d0151ba370a186e8583c9ab19348.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桜川 未央","creatorId":"vndb:s279","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s279","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s279","name":"小林 眞紀","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:15354","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c53042","characterName":"エル・キャンベル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["15363"],"vndbCharacterId":"c53042"},"originalCharacterName":"エル・キャンベル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【クロエ一筋・ダウナー系少女】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"職業：学園5期生　趣味：呪術の会得・クロエの世話　特技：呪術・毒薬作成"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園5期生。古書管理委員会委員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クロエに心酔するダウナー系少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"召喚魔法を教える学園で学びながら、なぜか様々な呪いや不幸のまじない、毒物に悪魔交信（電波受信？）など、ムダ知識が豊富。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性嫌いの傾向があるため、召喚されてクロエたちと共同生活を送ることになった主人公に、並々ならぬ敵愾心を抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フローラとは入学以来のルームメイトで、周囲からは『良いコンビ』と認識されるが、本人たちはイヤな顔をする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今日も今日とて、どうにかして主人公が不慮の事故に遭わないかと呪いをかける日々。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15363","sourceWorkId":"12402","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d0c74f23c8347e6c953cc30abc854b1f31c89ddd53fd91bba665d0a591e4caa2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25f5b4f05f2c563be4802a026a8633f0e66af3c5b7d0f2a8bf1c25f6542c4761.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大波 こなみ","creatorId":"vndb:s260","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s260","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s260","name":"幡宮 かのこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:15353","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c53043","characterName":"ヘルガ・ヘッセ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["15364"],"vndbCharacterId":"c53043"},"originalCharacterName":"ヘルガ・ヘッセ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【みんなの『おねえちゃん』】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"職業：学園7期生　趣味：学園散歩・世話好き　特技：前触れもなく会話に混ざる（神出鬼没）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園7期生。前生徒会長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フランチェスカを生徒会長に任命した張本人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理由は『やー、ほら、なんかあーいうのをトップにしといたら楽しそうかな、と』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教員側からは様々に反対意見も出たらしいが、ヘルガが言葉巧みに説得し、結局は今の形で落ち着いた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フランクで飾らない性格のため、学園の先輩というよりもみんなの『おねえちゃん』として認識されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人もそれを自負して嬉しがっていたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フラン、クロエ、ナタリアの同室計画を立案し、実行に移させたのはヘルガであるらしいが……？"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15364","sourceWorkId":"12402","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/06b889de1df562f9560848cb09e6ae59e9698eb62f44c854021307ba5721e524.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71db90ed1ca0515ee7535a71d0033fb3d59285198a86dc58e0287be5f0f7a34f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"まき いづみ","creatorId":"vndb:s365","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s365","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s365","name":"やなせ なつみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:15356","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c53044","characterName":"レムリア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c53044"},"originalCharacterName":"レムリア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/dff2ae574f83e4fe72bb0b089ec25e23f909527c20290fcd4fc35cb8d2712fde.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/84add36173626826f6d58d9a09e410f9bfb7c6b91eac6f2651d593c2d0d5f7d5.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c53045","characterName":"トリスメギストス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c53045"},"originalCharacterName":"トリスメギストス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https